{"step_index":149,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-29T15:31:29Z","input_tokens":21538,"cache_read_tokens":150997,"output_tokens":20216,"thinking":"Redesigned the dashboard as a modern enterprise command center, achieving the desired clean aesthetic. The updated dashboard will be saved to the specified artifact directory for preview within the current session. The system now needs to locate the user's artifact directory path to ensure correct saving.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"CivicSync Enterprise Municipal Operations Dashboard:\n- Multi-view navigation tabs (Triage Queue, GIS Density Map, Duplicate Review Hub, SLA Escalations, City Analytics).\n- Live KPI Metrics bar (Critical immediate dispatch, High priority, Corroborated reports, L1 Overdue).\n- Fast Lane 1-click batch verification ribbon.\n- Slide-over Ticket Inspection Drawer with explainable scoring breakdown, on-device privacy blur preview, before/after resolution validation, and audit timeline.\n- Full-screen GIS Leaflet Map with ST_SnapToGrid 250m density cells and ward overlays.\n- Side-by-side Duplicate Review Workbench (25m–50m distance delta).\n- SLA & Working Hours Escalation Center (Mon-Sat 10:00-17:00 IST).\n- Executive City Analytics charts (hazard class distribution and resolution velocity).\n- Role-based switcher (Ward Officer, Crew Lead, Zonal Engineer, City Admin) and CSV export.","UserFacing":true},"Content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>CivicSync · Municipal Operations Command Center</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css\" />\n  <script src=\"https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js@4.4.1/dist/chart.umd.min.js\"></script>\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n  <style>\n    :root {\n      --primary: #2563EB;\n      --primary-dark: #1D4ED8;\n      --primary-light: #EFF6FF;\n      --primary-border: #BFDBFE;\n      --slate-50: #F8FAFC;\n      --slate-100: #F1F5F9;\n      --slate-200: #E2E8F0;\n      --slate-300: #CBD5E1;\n      --slate-400: #94A3B8;\n      --slate-500: #64748B;\n      --slate-600: #475569;\n      --slate-700: #334155;\n      --slate-800: #1E293B;\n      --slate-900: #0F172A;\n\n      --critical: #DC2626;\n      --critical-bg: #FEF2F2;\n      --critical-border: #FECACA;\n      --high: #EA580C;\n      --high-bg: #FFF7ED;\n      --high-border: #FFEDD5;\n      --medium: #D97706;\n      --medium-bg: #FFFBEB;\n      --medium-border: #FEF3C7;\n      --low: #16A34A;\n      --low-bg: #F0FDF4;\n      --low-border: #DCFCE7;\n\n      --radius-sm: 6px;\n      --radius-md: 10px;\n      --radius-lg: 14px;\n      --radius-full: 9999px;\n      --shadow-sm: 0 1px 2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n      --shadow-md: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08), 0 2px 4px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n      --shadow-lg: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 4px 6px -4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n      --shadow-xl: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 8px 10px -6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n    }\n\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n    body {\n      font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;\n      background-color: var(--slate-50);\n      color: var(--slate-800);\n      height: 100vh;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n    }\n\n    /* TOP GLOBAL HEADER */\n    .app-header {\n      background: white;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--slate-200);\n      height: 68px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      padding: 0 28px;\n      z-index: 100;\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n    }\n    .header-left {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 28px;\n    }\n    .brand-container {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 12px;\n      text-decoration: none;\n      color: inherit;\n    }\n    .brand-icon {\n      width: 40px;\n      height: 40px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1D4ED8 0%, #3B82F6 100%);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      color: white;\n      font-size: 20px;\n      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.3);\n    }\n    .brand-name {\n      font-size: 1.25rem;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n      color: var(--slate-900);\n      line-height: 1.1;\n    }\n    .brand-subtitle {\n      font-size: 0.75rem;\n      color: var(--slate-500);\n      font-weight: 500;\n    }\n    .live-pulse {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 6px;\n      padding: 4px 10px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-full);\n      background: var(--low-bg);\n      border: 1px solid var(--low-border);\n      font-size: 0.75rem;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: var(--low);\n    }\n    .pulse-dot {\n      width: 7px;\n      height: 7px;\n      background: var(--low);\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.7);\n      animation: pulse 1.8s infinite;\n    }\n    @keyframes pulse {\n      0% { transform: scale(0.95); box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.7); }\n      70% { transform: scale(1); box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px rgba(22, 163, 74, 0); }\n      100% { transform: scale(0.95); box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(22, 163, 74, 0); }\n    }\n\n    /* PRIMARY NAVIGATION TABS */\n    .nav-tabs {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 4px;\n      background: var(--slate-100);\n      padding: 4px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n    }\n    .nav-tab-btn {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n      padding: 8px 16px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n      border: none;\n      background: transparent;\n      color: var(--slate-600);\n      font-weight: 600;\n      font-size: 0.85rem;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: all 0.15s ease-in-out;\n    }\n    .nav-tab-btn:hover {\n      color: var(--slate-900);\n    }\n    .nav-tab-btn.active {\n      background: white;\n      color: var(--primary);\n      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);\n    }\n    .tab-counter {\n      background: var(--slate-200);\n      color: var(--slate-700);\n      padding: 1px 7px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-full);\n      font-size: 0.7rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n    .nav-tab-btn.active .tab-counter {\n      background: var(--primary-light);\n      color: var(--primary);\n    }\n\n    /* HEADER RIGHT ACTIONS */\n    .header-right {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 16px;\n    }\n    .city-picker {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      background: var(--slate-100);\n      padding: 4px 10px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n      border: 1px solid var(--slate-200);\n      font-size: 0.8rem;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: var(--slate-700);\n    }\n    .city-picker select {\n      border: none;\n      background: transparent;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      font-size: 0.8rem;\n      color: var(--slate-800);\n      outline: none;\n      margin-left: 6px;\n      cursor: pointer;\n    }\n    .role-pill {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 10px;\n      background: white;\n      border: 1px solid var(--slate-200);\n      padding: 6px 14px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-full);\n      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);\n    }\n    .avatar {\n      width: 32px;\n      height: 32px;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      background: #E0E7FF;\n      color: #4338CA;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      font-size: 0.85rem;\n    }\n    .role-info {\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n    }\n    .user-name {\n      font-size: 0.82rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: var(--slate-900);\n      line-height: 1.1;\n    }\n    .role-select-native {\n      border: none;\n      background: transparent;\n      font-size: 0.75rem;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: var(--primary);\n      cursor: pointer;\n      outline: none;\n    }\n\n    /* MAIN APP BODY */\n    .app-main {\n      flex: 1;\n      display: flex;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n\n    /* VIEW PANELS */\n    .view-panel {\n      display: none;\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 100%;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n    .view-panel.active {\n      display: flex;\n    }\n\n    /* 1. TRIAGE QUEUE VIEW */\n    .triage-container {\n      display: flex;\n      flex: 1;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n    .triage-sidebar {\n      width: 280px;\n      background: white;\n      border-right: 1px solid var(--slate-200);\n      padding: 20px;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 24px;\n      overflow-y: auto;\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n    }\n    .sidebar-section-title {\n      font-size: 0.75rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n      color: var(--slate-400);\n      margin-bottom: 12px;\n    }\n    .filter-list {\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 6px;\n    }\n    .filter-item {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      padding: 9px 12px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n      font-size: 0.85rem;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: var(--slate-600);\n      background: transparent;\n      border: 1px solid transparent;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: all 0.15s;\n    }\n    .filter-item:hover {\n      background: var(--slate-100);\n      color: var(--slate-900);\n    }\n    .filter-item.active {\n      background: var(--primary-light);\n      border-color: var(--primary-border);\n      color: var(--primary);\n    }\n    .filter-item .count {\n      font-size: 0.72rem;\n      background: var(--slate-200);\n      padding: 2px 7px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-full);\n      color: var(--slate-700);\n    }\n    .filter-item.active .count {\n      background: var(--primary);\n      color: white;\n    }\n\n    /* QUEUE WORKSPACE */\n    .queue-workspace {\n      flex: 1;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      background: var(--slate-50);\n    }\n    \n    /* KPI METRICS BAR */\n    .kpi-row {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n      gap: 16px;\n      padding: 20px 24px 12px 24px;\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n    }\n    .kpi-card {\n      background: white;\n      border: 1px solid var(--slate-200);\n      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n      padding: 16px 20px;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 4px;\n      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);\n      position: relative;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n    .kpi-card::before {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 0;\n      left: 0;\n      bottom: 0;\n      width: 4px;\n      background: var(--primary);\n    }\n    .kpi-card.critical::before { background: var(--critical); }\n    .kpi-card.high::before { background: var(--high); }\n    .kpi-card.sla::before { background: #9333EA; }\n    .kpi-header {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: center;\n    }\n    .kpi-label {\n      font-size: 0.78rem;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: var(--slate-500);\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.03em;\n    }\n    .kpi-value {\n      font-size: 1.8rem;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      color: var(--slate-900);\n      line-height: 1.1;\n      letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n    }\n    .kpi-trend {\n      font-size: 0.75rem;\n      color: var(--slate-500);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 4px;\n    }\n    .kpi-trend.positive { color: var(--low); font-weight: 600; }\n\n    /* FAST LANE PROMINENT BANNER */\n    .fast-lane-strip {\n      margin: 8px 24px 12px 24px;\n      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1E3A8A 0%, #2563EB 100%);\n      color: white;\n      padding: 12px 20px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.25);\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n    }\n    .fast-lane-text {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 14px;\n    }\n    .fast-lane-badge {\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);\n      padding: 4px 10px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-full);\n      font-size: 0.75rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 6px;\n    }\n    .fast-lane-btn {\n      background: white;\n      color: var(--primary-dark);\n      border: none;\n      padding: 8px 18px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n      font-weight: 700;\n      font-size: 0.85rem;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 6px;\n      transition: all 0.15s;\n    }\n    .fast-lane-btn:hover {\n      background: var(--primary-light);\n      transform: translateY(-1px);\n    }\n\n    /* QUEUE FILTER & SEARCH TOOLBAR */\n    .queue-toolbar {\n      padding: 0 24px 12px 24px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      gap: 16px;\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n    }\n    .search-input-wrapper {\n      position: relative;\n      flex: 1;\n      max-width: 380px;\n    }\n    .search-input {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 40px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n      border: 1px solid var(--slate-200);\n      background: white;\n      padding: 0 14px 0 38px;\n      font-size: 0.85rem;\n      outline: none;\n      transition: border-color 0.15s;\n    }\n    .search-input:focus {\n      border-color: var(--primary);\n      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.1);\n    }\n    .search-icon {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 12px;\n      top: 50%;\n      transform: translateY(-50%);\n      color: var(--slate-400);\n      font-size: 16px;\n    }\n    .toolbar-actions {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 10px;\n    }\n    .btn-outline {\n      height: 40px;\n      padding: 0 14px;\n      background: white;\n      border: 1px solid var(--slate-200);\n      border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n      font-size: 0.85rem;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: var(--slate-700);\n      cursor: pointer;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 6px;\n    }\n    .btn-outline:hover { background: var(--slate-100); }\n\n    /* TICKET CARDS LIST */\n    .tickets-scroll-area {\n      flex: 1;\n      overflow-y: auto;\n      padding: 0 24px 24px 24px;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 12px;\n    }\n    .ticket-row-card {\n      background: white;\n      border: 1px solid var(--slate-200);\n      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n      padding: 16px 20px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 20px;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: all 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\n      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);\n      position: relative;\n    }\n    .ticket-row-card:hover {\n      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);\n      transform: translateY(-2px);\n      border-color: var(--primary-border);\n    }\n    .ticket-row-card.active {\n      border-color: var(--primary);\n      box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.2);\n    }\n\n    /* DYNAMIC SCORE BADGE */\n    .score-box {\n      width: 64px;\n      height: 64px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      color: white;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);\n    }\n    .score-box .num { font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 1; }\n    .score-box .lbl { font-size: 0.65rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-top: 2px; }\n    .score-box.critical { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #EF4444 0%, #B91C1C 100%); }\n    .score-box.high { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #F97316 0%, #C2410C 100%); }\n    .score-box.medium { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #F59E0B 0%, #B45309 100%); }\n    .score-box.low { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10B981 0%, #047857 100%); }\n\n    /* TICKET CONTENT BLOCKS */\n    .ticket-main {\n      flex: 1;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 6px;\n    }\n    .ticket-title-line {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 12px;\n    }\n    .ticket-id {\n      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n      font-size: 0.8rem;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: var(--slate-500);\n      background: var(--slate-100);\n      padding: 2px 6px;\n      border-radius: 4px;\n    }\n    .ticket-hazard-type {\n      font-size: 1.05rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: var(--slate-900);\n      text-transform: capitalize;\n    }\n    .status-badge {\n      font-size: 0.72rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      padding: 3px 10px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-full);\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n    }\n    .status-badge.reported { background: #FEF3C7; color: #92400E; }\n    .status-badge.verified { background: #DBEAFE; color: #1E40AF; }\n    .status-badge.assigned { background: #E0E7FF; color: #3730A3; }\n    .status-badge.resolved { background: #DCFCE7; color: #166534; }\n    .status-badge.rejected { background: #FEE2E2; color: #991B1B; }\n\n    .ticket-explanation {\n      font-size: 0.88rem;\n      color: var(--slate-600);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 6px;\n    }\n    .ticket-meta-row {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 20px;\n      font-size: 0.78rem;\n      color: var(--slate-500);\n      margin-top: 2px;\n    }\n    .meta-tag {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 6px;\n    }\n\n    /* RIGHT SLA INDICATOR */\n    .ticket-sla-box {\n      text-align: right;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      align-items: flex-end;\n      gap: 6px;\n      min-width: 140px;\n    }\n    .sla-countdown {\n      font-size: 0.85rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 6px;\n    }\n    .sla-countdown.green { color: var(--low); }\n    .sla-countdown.amber { color: var(--medium); }\n    .sla-countdown.red { color: var(--critical); }\n    .sla-bar-bg {\n      width: 120px;\n      height: 6px;\n      background: var(--slate-200);\n      border-radius: var(--radius-full);\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n    .sla-bar-fill {\n      height: 100%;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-full);\n    }\n    .sla-bar-fill.green { width: 35%; background: var(--low); }\n    .sla-bar-fill.amber { width: 75%; background: var(--medium); }\n    .sla-bar-fill.red { width: 100%; background: var(--critical); }\n\n    /* SLIDE-OVER DETAIL DRAWER */\n    .detail-drawer {\n      width: 480px;\n      background: white;\n      border-left: 1px solid var(--slate-200);\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      overflow-y: auto;\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n      box-shadow: -4px 0 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n    }\n    .drawer-header {\n      padding: 20px 24px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--slate-200);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      position: sticky;\n      top: 0;\n      background: white;\n      z-index: 10;\n    }\n    .drawer-title { font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--slate-900); }\n    .drawer-body {\n      padding: 24px;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 20px;\n    }\n    .photo-preview-card {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 220px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n      overflow: hidden;\n      position: relative;\n      background: var(--slate-800);\n    }\n    .photo-preview-card img {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 100%;\n      object-fit: cover;\n    }\n    .privacy-shield-tag {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 12px;\n      right: 12px;\n      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85);\n      backdrop-filter: blur(4px);\n      color: #4ADE80;\n      padding: 5px 12px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-full);\n      font-size: 0.72rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 6px;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.3);\n    }\n    \n    .formula-breakdown-card {\n      background: var(--slate-50);\n      border: 1px solid var(--slate-200);\n      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n      padding: 16px;\n    }\n    .formula-title {\n      font-size: 0.8rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      color: var(--slate-500);\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n    }\n    .formula-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n      gap: 10px;\n      font-size: 0.82rem;\n    }\n    .formula-cell {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      padding: 6px 10px;\n      background: white;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n      border: 1px solid var(--slate-200);\n    }\n    .formula-cell .val { font-weight: 700; color: var(--slate-900); }\n\n    .action-panel-card {\n      background: var(--primary-light);\n      border: 1px solid var(--primary-border);\n      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n      padding: 18px;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 12px;\n    }\n    .action-panel-title {\n      font-size: 0.85rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: var(--primary-dark);\n    }\n    .btn-group-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n      gap: 10px;\n    }\n    .btn-solid-primary {\n      background: var(--primary);\n      color: white;\n      border: none;\n      padding: 10px 16px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n      font-weight: 700;\n      font-size: 0.85rem;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n      transition: all 0.15s;\n    }\n    .btn-solid-primary:hover { background: var(--primary-dark); }\n    .btn-solid-success {\n      background: var(--low);\n      color: white;\n      border: none;\n      padding: 10px 16px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n      font-weight: 700;\n      font-size: 0.85rem;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n    }\n    .btn-solid-danger {\n      background: white;\n      color: var(--critical);\n      border: 1px solid var(--critical-border);\n      padding: 10px 16px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n      font-weight: 700;\n      font-size: 0.85rem;\n      cursor: pointer;\n    }\n\n    /* 2. FULL-SCREEN GIS DENSITY MAP VIEW */\n    .map-view-container {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 100%;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n    #gis-full-map {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 100%;\n    }\n    .map-floating-panel {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 20px;\n      left: 20px;\n      background: white;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n      padding: 16px 20px;\n      box-shadow: var(--shadow-xl);\n      border: 1px solid var(--slate-200);\n      z-index: 1000;\n      max-width: 320px;\n    }\n    .map-floating-panel h3 { font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--slate-900); }\n    .map-floating-panel p { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--slate-500); margin-top: 4px; }\n    .map-legend { margin-top: 12px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; font-size: 0.75rem; }\n    .legend-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }\n    .legend-box { width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 3px; }\n\n    /* 3. DUPLICATE RESOLUTION HUB */\n    .duplicate-hub {\n      padding: 28px;\n      overflow-y: auto;\n      max-width: 1100px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      width: 100%;\n    }\n    .hub-header { margin-bottom: 24px; }\n    .hub-header h2 { font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--slate-900); }\n    .hub-header p { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--slate-500); margin-top: 4px; }\n    .dup-card {\n      background: white;\n      border: 1px solid var(--slate-200);\n      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n      padding: 24px;\n      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);\n      margin-bottom: 24px;\n    }\n    .dup-comparison-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;\n      gap: 20px;\n      align-items: center;\n      margin: 20px 0;\n    }\n    .dup-side-box {\n      background: var(--slate-50);\n      border: 1px solid var(--slate-200);\n      border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n      padding: 16px;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 10px;\n    }\n    .dup-side-box img {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 160px;\n      object-fit: cover;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n    }\n    .dup-vs-divider {\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n    }\n    .distance-pill {\n      background: #FEF3C7;\n      color: #B45309;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      font-size: 0.85rem;\n      padding: 6px 14px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-full);\n      border: 1px solid #FDE68A;\n    }\n\n    /* 4. SLA ESCALATION MONITOR */\n    .sla-view-container {\n      padding: 28px;\n      overflow-y: auto;\n      max-width: 1200px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      width: 100%;\n    }\n    .sla-table-card {\n      background: white;\n      border: 1px solid var(--slate-200);\n      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n      overflow: hidden;\n      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);\n      margin-top: 20px;\n    }\n    .data-table {\n      width: 100%;\n      border-collapse: collapse;\n      text-align: left;\n      font-size: 0.85rem;\n    }\n    .data-table th {\n      background: var(--slate-50);\n      padding: 14px 20px;\n      color: var(--slate-500);\n      font-weight: 700;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      font-size: 0.72rem;\n      letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--slate-200);\n    }\n    .data-table td {\n      padding: 16px 20px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--slate-100);\n      color: var(--slate-800);\n    }\n    .data-table tr:hover { background: var(--slate-50); }\n\n    /* 5. EXECUTIVE ANALYTICS */\n    .analytics-view {\n      padding: 28px;\n      overflow-y: auto;\n      max-width: 1200px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      width: 100%;\n    }\n    .charts-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n      gap: 24px;\n      margin-top: 20px;\n    }\n    .chart-card {\n      background: white;\n      border: 1px solid var(--slate-200);\n      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n      padding: 24px;\n      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);\n    }\n    .chart-card h3 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <!-- TOP APP HEADER -->\n  <header class=\"app-header\">\n    <div class=\"header-left\">\n      <div class=\"brand-container\">\n        <div class=\"brand-icon\">🚦</div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"brand-name\">CivicSync</div>\n          <div class=\"brand-subtitle\">Municipal Operations Suite</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"live-pulse\">\n        <span class=\"pulse-dot\"></span>\n        <span>Agra & Jodhpur Live Stream</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Navigation Tabs -->\n      <nav class=\"nav-tabs\">\n        <button class=\"nav-tab-btn active\" onclick=\"switchNavTab('triage')\">\n          <span>📋 Triage Queue</span>\n          <span class=\"tab-counter\" id=\"badge-queue-count\">14</span>\n        </button>\n        <button class=\"nav-tab-btn\" onclick=\"switchNavTab('map')\">\n          <span>🗺️ GIS Density Map</span>\n        </button>\n        <button class=\"nav-tab-btn\" onclick=\"switchNavTab('duplicates')\">\n          <span>⚠️ Duplicate Hub</span>\n          <span class=\"tab-counter\" style=\"background:#FEF3C7; color:#B45309;\">2</span>\n        </button>\n        <button class=\"nav-tab-btn\" onclick=\"switchNavTab('sla')\">\n          <span>⏱️ SLA Escalations</span>\n          <span class=\"tab-counter\" style=\"background:#FEE2E2; color:#B91C1C;\">1</span>\n        </button>\n        <button class=\"nav-tab-btn\" onclick=\"switchNavTab('analytics')\">\n          <span>📊 City Analytics</span>\n        </button>\n      </nav>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Header Right Controls -->\n    <div class=\"header-right\">\n      <div class=\"city-picker\">\n        <span>📍 City:</span>\n        <select id=\"header-city-filter\" onchange=\"handleCityFilterChange()\">\n          <option value=\"all\">All Pilot Cities</option>\n          <option value=\"Agra\" selected>Agra (UP)</option>\n          <option value=\"Jodhpur\">Jodhpur (RJ)</option>\n        </select>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"role-pill\">\n        <div class=\"avatar\" id=\"user-avatar\">K</div>\n        <div class=\"role-info\">\n          <div class=\"user-name\" id=\"user-display-name\">Kavita (Ward Officer)</div>\n          <select class=\"role-select-native\" id=\"role-select\" onchange=\"handleRoleSwitch()\">\n            <option value=\"ward_officer\">Ward Officer (AGR-W01 Tajganj)</option>\n            <option value=\"crew_lead\">Deepak (Crew Lead)</option>\n            <option value=\"zonal_engineer\">Zonal Engineer (Agra North)</option>\n            <option value=\"city_admin\">Mr. Sharma (City Admin)</option>\n          </select>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <!-- MAIN APPLICATION BODY -->\n  <main class=\"app-main\">\n\n    <!-- VIEW 1: TRIAGE QUEUE & DRAWER -->\n    <div class=\"view-panel active\" id=\"view-triage\">\n      <div class=\"triage-container\">\n        \n        <aside class=\"triage-sidebar\">\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"sidebar-section-title\">Status Workflow</div>\n            <div class=\"filter-list\">\n              <button class=\"filter-item active\" onclick=\"setStatusFilter('all')\">\n                <span>All Active Tickets</span>\n                <span class=\"count\">14</span>\n              </button>\n              <button class=\"filter-item\" onclick=\"setStatusFilter('reported')\">\n                <span>Reported (Verify Needed)</span>\n                <span class=\"count\">6</span>\n              </button>\n              <button class=\"filter-item\" onclick=\"setStatusFilter('verified')\">\n                <span>Verified (Ready for Crew)</span>\n                <span class=\"count\">4</span>\n              </button>\n              <button class=\"filter-item\" onclick=\"setStatusFilter('assigned')\">\n                <span>Assigned (In Progress)</span>\n                <span class=\"count\">3</span>\n              </button>\n              <button class=\"filter-item\" onclick=\"setStatusFilter('resolved')\">\n                <span>Resolved (Verified Fixed)</span>\n                <span class=\"count\">1</span>\n              </button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"sidebar-section-title\">Filter by Ward</div>\n            <div class=\"filter-list\">\n              <button class=\"filter-item active\" onclick=\"setWardFilter('all')\">\n                <span>All Municipal Wards</span>\n                <span class=\"count\">14</span>\n              </button>\n              <button class=\"filter-item\" onclick=\"setWardFilter('AGR-W01')\">\n                <span>Tajganj (AGR-W01)</span>\n                <span class=\"count\">8</span>\n              </button>\n              <button class=\"filter-item\" onclick=\"setWardFilter('AGR-W02')\">\n                <span>Sanjay Place (AGR-W02)</span>\n                <span class=\"count\">3</span>\n              </button>\n              <button class=\"filter-item\" onclick=\"setWardFilter('JDH-W01')\">\n                <span>Ratanada (JDH-W01)</span>\n                <span class=\"count\">3</span>\n              </button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"sidebar-section-title\">Hazard Categories</div>\n            <div class=\"filter-list\">\n              <button class=\"filter-item\" onclick=\"setClassFilter('pothole')\">\n                <span>Potholes</span>\n                <span class=\"count\">8</span>\n              </button>\n              <button class=\"filter-item\" onclick=\"setClassFilter('open_drain')\">\n                <span>Open Drains / Manholes</span>\n                <span class=\"count\">2</span>\n              </button>\n              <button class=\"filter-item\" onclick=\"setClassFilter('waterlogging')\">\n                <span>Waterlogging</span>\n                <span class=\"count\">2</span>\n              </button>\n              <button class=\"filter-item\" onclick=\"setClassFilter('broken_road')\">\n                <span>Broken Surfaces</span>\n                <span class=\"count\">2</span>\n              </button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </aside>\n\n        <div class=\"queue-workspace\">\n          \n          <div class=\"kpi-row\">\n            <div class=\"kpi-card critical\">\n              <div class=\"kpi-header\">\n                <span class=\"kpi-label\">Critical Dispatch</span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:1.2rem;\">🚨</span>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"kpi-value\" id=\"kpi-critical\">3</div>\n              <div class=\"kpi-trend\">Score &ge; 75 · 4h SLA Target</div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"kpi-card high\">\n              <div class=\"kpi-header\">\n                <span class=\"kpi-label\">High Priority</span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:1.2rem;\">⚠️</span>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"kpi-value\" id=\"kpi-high\">5</div>\n              <div class=\"kpi-trend\">Score 55–74 · 1d SLA Target</div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"kpi-card\">\n              <div class=\"kpi-header\">\n                <span class=\"kpi-label\">Corroborated Reports</span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:1.2rem;\">👥</span>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"kpi-value\">9</div>\n              <div class=\"kpi-trend positive\">&plus;3pts Corroboration Bonus</div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"kpi-card sla\">\n              <div class=\"kpi-header\">\n                <span class=\"kpi-label\">SLA Overdue (L1)</span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:1.2rem;\">⏱️</span>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"kpi-value\" style=\"color:#9333EA;\">1</div>\n              <div class=\"kpi-trend\" style=\"color:#DC2626;\">Escalated to Zonal Lead</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"fast-lane-strip\">\n            <div class=\"fast-lane-text\">\n              <div class=\"fast-lane-badge\">⚡ FAST LANE</div>\n              <div>\n                <strong>High-Confidence Automated Triage</strong> · Model Conf &ge; 85%, GPS &le; 20m, Zero Quality Flags\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"fast-lane-btn\" onclick=\"executeFastLaneBatch()\">\n              <span>✓ 1-Click Batch Verify (2)</span>\n            </button>\n        